## Interface: 16001, 120105, 120107
## Title: ARL Extensions: EllesmereUI
## Notes: Extras for EllesmereUI: the quest tracker (item buttons, missing items, zone focus) and Item Lock for the bags.
## Author: aredpanda, andreg1
## Version: 0.5.0
## Group: ARLExtensions
## Dependencies: ARLExtensions
## OptionalDeps: EllesmereUI, EllesmereUIQuestTracker, EllesmereUIBags, QuestieDB, Questie
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## X-ARLE-Pack: EllesmereUI
## X-ARLE-Group: EllesmereUI
## X-ARLE-Features: EUIQuestItems, ItemLock
## X-ARLE-Feature-EUIQuestItems: title=Quest Tracker; extends=EllesmereUIQuestTracker; cmd=qt; replaces=EllesmereUIQuestTracker_QuestItems
## X-ARLE-Feature-ItemLock: title=Item Lock; extends=EllesmereUIBags; cmd=lock; default=off; replaces=EllesmereUIBags_ItemLock

QuestTracker.lua
ItemLock.lua
